<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FAQ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>

<body class="<%= bodyClass %>">

    <header>
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/areas">Areas</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/special-events">Events</a>
    </nav>

    <main class="faq-page">
        <section class="faq-box">
            <h2>Have Questions?</h2>
            <p>When is the park open? <br> The park is open every day from April to October, 9am to 7pm.</p>
            <p>Is parking available? <br> Yes, we have ample parking available for all visitors.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="faq-box-secondary">
            <h2>We Have the Answers!</h2>
            <p>Can we bring our own food? <br> Yes, you can bring your own food, but there are also many dining options available in the park.</p>
            <p>What age group is the park suitable for? <br> The park offers attractions for all age groups, from thrilling rides to family-friendly activities.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="faq-box-form">
            <h2>Ask a Question</h2>
            <form action="/submit-question" method="POST">
                <label for="email">Your Email:</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
                
                <label for="question">Your Question:</label>
                <textarea id="question" name="question" required></textarea>
                
                <button type="submit">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>
  
    <footer class="footer-container">
        <div>
            <p>&copy; 2024 Theme Park. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>